---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Case Studies — Proven System Results">
  <header class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border-subtle bg-white-surface/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
      <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-pink-brand rounded-chip flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs">DA</div>
      <span class="text-hero-heading font-bold text-lg">David Amayoor</span>
    </div>
    <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8 text-sm font-medium text-muted-text">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-hero-heading transition-colors">Home</a>
      <a href="/services" class="hover:text-hero-heading transition-colors">Services</a>
      <a href="/templates" class="hover:text-hero-heading transition-colors">Templates</a>
      <a href="/case-studies" class="text-pink-brand font-semibold">Case Studies</a>
      <a href="/about" class="hover:text-hero-heading transition-colors">About</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="/contact" class="px-4 py-2 bg-pink-brand text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-button shadow-sm hover:opacity-95">Book Call</a>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 space-y-16">
    <div class="text-center space-y-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-hero-heading">Proven System Results</h1>
      <p class="text-muted-text text-lg">Real-world operational transformations for scaling media agencies.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-8 bg-white-surface border border-border-subtle rounded-card space-y-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-chip-background text-xs font-mono font-bold text-pink-brand rounded-tag uppercase">Case Study #01</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-muted-text">Short-Form Video Agency</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-hero-heading">How a 5-Person Agency Saved 15+ Hours Weekly with Video Studio OS</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-text leading-relaxed">
        Before our architectural build, the agency suffered from fragmented communication across Slack and scattered Google Drive folders. Client revisions were consistently delayed.
      </p>
      <div class="p-6 bg-chip-background rounded-chip border border-border-subtle space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-hero-heading text-sm">Key Architectural Deliverables:</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-text text-sm">Centralized client intake database, automated status rollups, and structured script-to-screen pipelines.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="text-muted-text leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Result:</strong> Zero missed deadlines in the first quarter and a 40% increase in monthly client output capacity.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-border-subtle text-center text-sm text-faint-text mt-20">
    <p>© 2026 David Amayoor. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>